    "text": "电池包热管理：负载阶跃下温度约束与泵命令物理边界. 在给定放电电流工况与环境温度变化下，热控制器驱动冷却回路，将电芯温度维持在目标附近且不超过安全上限；泵命令保持在 0..1 并避免过度振荡。. Scenario time window 0s to 900s; inputs: ambient_temp_C_profile, enable, i_load_A_profile, temp_ref_C; initial conditions: coolant_temp_C, integrator, pump_state, soc, temp_cell_C. Acceptance criteria: max(temp_cell_C)_over_all <= 45.0; max(abs(temp_cell_C - temp_ref_C))_after_t=250s <= 6.0; within_range(pump_cmd) in [0.0, 1.0]; max(abs(d(pump_cmd)/dt)) <= 1.0; within_range(soc) in [0.0, 1.0]; within_range(v_term_V) in [250.0, 430.0]. Signals of interest: enable, temp_ref_C, ambient_temp_C, i_load_A, pump_cmd, sat_flag, coolant_temp_C, heat_removed_W, soc, temp_cell_C, heat_gen_W, v_term_V",
